  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"time_speed_distance","question":"Speed of stream is 2 km/hr. A boat goes 6 km and back in 4 hours. Speed of boat in still water is:","options":[{"text":"4 km/hr","isCorrect":true},{"text":"5 km/hr","isCorrect":false},{"text":"6 km/hr","isCorrect":false},{"text":"3 km/hr","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"6/(B+2)+6/(B-2)=4. Let B=4: 6/6+6/2=1+3=4✓","difficulty":"medium","marks":1},
  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"time_speed_distance","question":"Two cars start from the same place at the same time in opposite directions. If speeds are 50 and 40 km/hr, after how many hours will they be 225 km apart?","options":[{"text":"2.5","isCorrect":true},{"text":"3","isCorrect":false},{"text":"2","isCorrect":false},{"text":"3.5","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"Relative speed=90 km/hr. Time=225/90=2.5 hours","difficulty":"easy","marks":1},
  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"time_speed_distance","question":"A man covers a certain distance on scooter. Had he moved 3 km/hr faster, he would have taken 40 min less. If he moved 2 km/hr slower, he would have taken 40 min more. Distance is:","options":[{"text":"40 km","isCorrect":true},{"text":"36 km","isCorrect":false},{"text":"48 km","isCorrect":false},{"text":"30 km","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"D/S - D/(S+3)=2/3 and D/(S-2)-D/S=2/3. From these: 3D/S(S+3)=2/3 and 2D/S(S-2)=2/3. So 3D/S(S+3)=2D/S(S-2). 3(S-2)=2(S+3). 3S-6=2S+6. S=12. D=12×(12+3)×(2/3)/3=40km","difficulty":"hard","marks":1},
  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"time_speed_distance","question":"A train passes a standing man in 6 seconds and a 110m platform in 17 seconds. Length and speed of train:","options":[{"text":"60m, 36 km/hr","isCorrect":true},{"text":"55m, 40 km/hr","isCorrect":false},{"text":"70m, 42 km/hr","isCorrect":false},{"text":"50m, 30 km/hr","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"L/6=(L+110)/17. 17L=6L+660. 11L=660. L=60m. Speed=60/6=10m/s=36km/hr","difficulty":"medium","marks":1},
